eplit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:58:6" data-component-name="span" class="inline-block w-6 h-px" style="background: rgb(73, 121, 145);"></span>Why a membership</span><h2 data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:482:12" data-component-name="h2" class="font-serif font-normal mt-3 leading-[1.06]" style="font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.3vw, 3.5rem);">Don't just buy seafood. Build a practice.</h2><p data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:485:12" data-component-name="p" class="mt-5 max-w-[54ch] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgba(46, 75, 89, 0.66); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);">Seafood fueled human evolution — the marine omega-3s that shaped our brains and longevity came from the sea. That benefit is real, but it lives in the repetition, not the occasional splurge.</p></div><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:489:10" data-component-name="div" class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-14 mt-14 items-stretch"><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:490:12" data-component-name="div" class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:491:14" data-component-name="div" class="rounded-md p-8" style="background: rgb(205, 217, 209);"><span data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:492:16" data-component-name="span" class="block font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-3" style="color: rgb(73, 121, 145);">The idea</span><h3 data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:495:16" data-component-name="h3" class="font-serif mb-3" style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 500;">The benefit is in the repetition.</h3><p data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:498:16" data-component-name="p" class="leading-relaxed" style="color: rgba(46, 75, 89, 0.66);">One great piece of fish is a lovely dinner. Eating clean, omega-rich seafood three to four times a week is what actually moves your numbers — and that only happens when it's already in your kitchen.</p></div><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:502:14" data-component-name="div" class="rounded-md p-8" style="background: rgb(46, 75, 89); color: rgb(247, 239, 230);"><span data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:503:16" data-component-name="span" class="block font-mono text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-3" style="color: rgb(123, 195, 243);">The membership</span><h3 data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:506:16" data-component-name="h3" class="font-serif text-white mb-3" style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 500;">We make repetition effortless.</h3><p data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:509:16" data-component-name="p" class="leading-relaxed" style="color: rgba(247, 239, 230, 0.74);">A box you customize, delivered on ocean time and verified clean per batch — with chef classes and a concierge so cooking it stays a pleasure, not a project. The habit does the rest.</p></div></div><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:514:12" data-component-name="div" class="relative rounded-md overflow-hidden min-h-[320px] lg:min-h-0" role="img" aria-label="A prepared plate of clean, sashimi-grade Seatopia seafood" style="background: url(&quot;https://seatopia.fish/cdn/shop/files/Color-Edited-2-7_1.jpg?v=1781872437&amp;width=1400&quot;) center center / cover rgb(29, 61, 62);"><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:520:14" data-component-name="div" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7 font-serif italic" style="background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(29, 61, 62, 0.92), transparent); color: rgb(247, 239, 230); font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.3;">Food as medicine, not marketing.</div></div></div></div></section><section data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:537:6" data-component-name="section" class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 sm:py-28" id="standard" style="background: rgb(46, 75, 89); color: rgb(247, 239, 230);"><div d