3, 121, 145);">EPA + DHA · CARDIOVASCULAR</span></div><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:636:16" data-component-name="div" class="rounded-md p-8 flex flex-col gap-3 border transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1" data-testid="health-card-Energy &amp; recovery" style="background: rgb(251, 249, 243); border-color: rgba(46, 75, 89, 0.15);"><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:642:18" data-component-name="div" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center" style="background: rgb(46, 75, 89); color: rgb(123, 195, 243);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-5 h-5" data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:643:20" data-component-name="Icon"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:645:18" data-component-name="h3" class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.24rem; font-weight: 500;">Energy &amp; recovery</h3><p data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:648:18" data-component-name="p" class="text-[0.94rem]" style="color: rgba(46, 75, 89, 0.66);">Omega-3s support recovery and a healthy inflammatory response as you move more, train more, and spend more time in the world.</p><span data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:651:18" data-component-name="span" class="mt-auto pt-2 font-mono text-[0.7rem] tracking-wide" style="color: rgb(73, 121, 145);">OMEGA-3 · RECOVERY</span></div></div><div data-replit-metadata="client/src/pages/Membership.tsx:659:10" data-component-name="div" class="mt-14 rounded-md grid lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] gap-10 items-center" style="background: rgb(46, 75, 89); color: rgb(247, 239, 230); p